<title>USA: Uniroyal Goodrich labor talks recessed.</title>
<headline>Uniroyal Goodrich labor talks recessed.</headline>
<dateline>KNOXVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Steelworkers of America said Wednesday it agreed with Continental AG's Uniroyal Goodrich Tire Manufacturing to recess master contract negotiations pending the resolution of separate talks between the union and Goodyear Tire &amp; Rubber Co.</p>
<p>The contract with Uniroyal, which expired April 19, continues to be extended on a day-to-day basis for about 4,000 employees at three U.S. locations -- Fort Wayne, Ind., Opelika, Ala., and Tuscaloosa, Ala.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
